      description: 'Amboseli National Park is home to some of Africa\'s most spectacular and photogenic wildlife. The park\'s open plains, dry lake beds, and year-round swamps create a mosaic of habitats that support enormous elephant herds, resident big cats, buffaloes, wildebeest, and over 600 bird species — all set against the dramatic backdrop of Mount Kilimanjaro.',

