          'Reliable Endemic Access — all three Arabuko endemics (Sokoke scops-owl, Sokoke pipit, Clarke\'s weaver) are resident year-round and accessible with good local guides.',
          'Excellent Ground-Level Visibility — lower humidity reduces mist and condensation, and reduced leaf density in some zones makes spotting forest-floor species like golden-rumped elephant shrew easier.',
