          'All Five Samburu Specials — thinned vegetation makes locating Grevy\'s zebra, Beisa oryx, gerenuk, reticulated giraffe, and Somali ostrich in the interior scrublands far easier.',
          'Peak Predator Viewing — lions and leopards are most active and visible during cooler dry-season mornings, often found near river crossings and waterhole approaches.',
          'Good Road Conditions — dry tracks in all reserve areas are firm and accessible, including the more remote inland circuits.',
