      thingsToDoPreview: [
        {
          description: 'Game drives along the Tana River circuit and through the spectacular kopje landscape are the primary wildlife activity. Guided walks on the rock inselbergs with armed rangers provide extraordinary geological and wildlife perspectives. Visiting George Adamson\'s camp at Kampi ya Simba — a pilgrimage site for "Born Free" enthusiasts — and the memorial at Adamson\'s Falls on the Tana are deeply evocative experiences. Fly-camping under the stars beside the river and evening campfire sessions under the ancient kopjes complete an expedition-style safari that very few Kenya visitors ever experience.'
        }
      ],

