        description: 'The best time to visit Lake Turkana is from October to March when temperatures are at their lowest, the Turkana winds are less intense, and the lake is most accessible. November to February is the peak visiting period. The lake can be visited year-round for the most committed adventurers, but the April–May rains affect road access and the June–September winds make boating and camping very uncomfortable.',
        linkText: 'More about the best time to visit'
