          fullReview: 'I have travelled to over 80 countries. Lake Turkana is among the top five most extraordinary places I have ever seen. The jade colour of the water against the black volcanic rock at sunset. The thousands of crocodiles on Central Island. The El Molo fishermen pushing out their rafts at dawn. The silence and scale of the desert. This is the Africa that most people never see — and it is staggering.',
