        {
          description: 'Lewa offers the widest and most sophisticated range of wildlife activities of any Kenya conservancy. Guided day game drives and night drives in custom-built safari vehicles, walking safaris with expert Lewa rangers and tracking teams, horse safaris through the conservancy\'s open grasslands and forests, rhino tracking — both black and white — on foot, camel-back safaris with Samburu guides, community visits to Lewa\'s partner villages, conservation talks with Lewa\'s wildlife management team, fly-fishing in the Ngare Ndare forest pools, and helicopter flights over the conservancy and Mount Kenya landscape complete an activity menu that no other Kenya destination can match. Many camps also offer private dining in the bush, bush breakfast beside a herd of elephants, and sundowner drinks at private kopje viewpoints.'
        }
