        description: 'Mara Naboisho sits at 1,500–1,800m in the greater Masai Mara ecosystem with a highland climate that is pleasantly temperate year-round. Temperatures range from 12°C to 28°C (54°F to 82°F). Two rainy seasons apply: long rains from March to May and short rains from October to November. The dry seasons (June to October and January to March) are the best visiting periods. The Mara\'s famous July–October wildebeest migration season corresponds with the dry season and is the peak period for the overall Masai Mara ecosystem.',
