        fullReview: 'Naboisho has solved the fundamental problem of the modern Masai Mara safari. The wildlife — lions, cheetahs, leopards, elephants — is every bit as exceptional as anywhere in the ecosystem. But the experience is completely transformed by the exclusivity. One vehicle at a lion sighting, not twenty. Time to watch behaviour develop over an hour without pressure to move on. The ability to go off-road when a leopard walks into the bush. Walking across the open plains in genuine predator country. This is the Mara I fell in love with during eighteen years of research — and Naboisho has preserved it for future generations through its community model.',
