          rating: 5,
          excerpt: 'I have filmed and written about African wildlife for nearly three decades. The Masai Mara remains the single most important destination on the continent — not despite its fame, but because of what earned it. The Migration crossing at the Mara River is the most visceral wildlife spectacle on Earth. The lion prides are incomparable. The landscape, the light, the scale — there is simply nothing else like it...'
