          'Passport valid for at least six months required.',
          'All visitors require an Electronic Travel Authorisation (eTA) at www.etakenya.go.ke.',
          'Park entry fees payable at the gate (USD for non-residents).',
          'Rhino sanctuary entry requires a separate KWS permit — arrange in advance through your operator.',
          'All game drives require a 4×4 vehicle; the Chyulu Hills tracks require high ground clearance in the wet season.'
