      introText: 'Arusha National Park carries low to moderate malaria risk. The highland location (1,500m+) significantly reduces Anopheles mosquito activity compared to lowland Tanzanian parks. Antimalarial prophylaxis is nonetheless recommended. The park is one of the safest in Tanzania for outdoor activities including walking and canoeing.',
