        description: `Katavi is only accessible from July to October — the park closes completely from November to June when the floodplains flood and the airstrips become inoperative. Within the safari window, August to October delivers the peak wildlife concentrations as the floodpools reach minimum size. September and October are widely considered the finest months when hippo concentrations are most intense, buffalo herds are largest, and predator activity peaks around the water sources. July is excellent but concentrations are still building. October is the final month before the rains begin and represents the absolute peak of the dry-season wildlife spectacle.`
