        { title: 'August & September', description: 'Peak season. The driest and most comfortable months for chimpanzee trekking. M-group most reliably found at lower forest elevations. Lake Tanganyika at its clearest. Lodge occupancy highest — book permits and accommodation well in advance. Temperatures 20–30°C (68–86°F).' },
        { title: 'October', description: 'Excellent conditions continuing into October. Short rains beginning to develop from late October. Still the best birding of the year in combination with good chimpanzee trek conditions. Transition month — combine dry-season wildlife reliability with the first signs of the forest greening.' }
