      fullReview: 'Mkomazi is Tanzania\'s most private and most underappreciated park. For black rhino, Tsavo-ecosystem dry-country species, and complete wilderness solitude, it has no competitor on the Tanzania northern circuit.',
      helpful: 38, avatar: null
