      note: 'There is no airstrip on the Ngorongoro crater rim. All visitors arrive by road from Arusha or from other northern circuit parks. Some operators use Manyara Airstrip (30km from the NCA gate) for fly-in access from Serengeti or Dar es Salaam.',
