      credentials: 'Tanzania National Parks Authority licensed guide, 14 years Tarangire National Park.',
      title: 'Africa\'s Highest Elephant Concentration in the Most Beautiful Baobab Landscape on Earth — Tarangire in October Is Incomparable',
      rating: 5, date: 'October 2025',
