      title: 'Uganda\'s Finest Birding Walk, Its Second-Largest Chimpanzee Population, and Ancient Mahogany Forest — Budongo Deserves Far More Visitors Than It Gets',
      rating: 5, date: 'August 2025',
      excerpt: 'Visitors who skip Budongo on the way to Murchison are making a significant mistake. The Royal Mile alone is worth the detour.',
