    introText: `Budongo Forest Reserve at 900–1,350m has a mild, humid tropical highland climate with two rainy seasons — March to May (long rains) and October to November (short rains). Temperatures are moderate year-round: 18–28°C (64–82°F). The forest is humid and paths can be slippery at all seasons; waterproof footwear is always recommended.`,
