    introText: `Bwindi Impenetrable National Park is open for gorilla trekking year-round. The best trekking conditions are June to August (main dry season) and December to February (short dry season). Gorilla encounters are equally rewarding in all seasons. Peak season permits must be booked 6–12 months in advance.`,
