      rating: 4, date: 'October 2025',
      excerpt: 'Seven visits over fourteen years and I have never shared the reserve with another tourist group. The sitatunga, shoebill, and papyrus specialists are the draw. The solitude is the bonus. Katonga should be on every advanced Uganda itinerary.',
