      description: `Lake Mburo National Park offers rewarding wildlife viewing year-round. June to August and December to February (dry seasons) offer the best conditions for game drives, horseback safaris, and night drives — shorter grass and easier animal location. Boat trips on the lake are excellent in all seasons. The wet season (March to May, October to November) produces lush and beautiful landscapes, very active birding, and lower rates, with wildlife viewing somewhat more challenging on land.`
